---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Bidwell Capital - Building Generational Wealth Through Cash-Flowing Assets" description="Bidwell Capital partners with investors to build long-term wealth through productive real assets, disciplined underwriting, and trusted operator relationships.">
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="section-label fade-up fade-up-1">Bidwell Capital</span>
      <h1 class="fade-up fade-up-2">Building generational wealth<br/>through cash-flowing assets</h1>
      <p class="hero-sub fade-up fade-up-3">Bidwell Capital partners with investors to build long-term wealth through productive real assets, disciplined underwriting, and trusted operator relationships.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions fade-up fade-up-4">
        <a href="/philosophy" class="btn btn-primary">View Investment Philosophy</a>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-outline">Connect With Us</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Stats -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="grid-3">
        <div class="stat-card card fade-up fade-up-2">
          <span class="stat-value">$14.3M+</span>
          <span class="stat-label">Invested</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card card fade-up fade-up-3">
          <span class="stat-value">$920K+</span>
          <span class="stat-label">Distributed</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card card fade-up fade-up-4">
          <span class="stat-value">113</span>
          <span class="stat-label">Investors</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Intro / Philosophy -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container intro-narrow">
      <span class="section-label">Our Approach</span>
      <h2>Productive assets, patient ownership, durable value.</h2>
      <p class="lede">We believe wealth is built through productive assets, patient ownership, and relationships developed over time. Rather than chasing trends, Bidwell Capital focuses on cash-flowing opportunities where experience, operational insight, and trusted partnerships can create durable value.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What We Invest In -->
  <section class="section section-tint">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="section-label">What We Invest In</span>
      <h2>Three investment verticals, one philosophy.</h2>
      <p class="section-intro">Each vertical centers on cash flow and disciplined underwriting. On much of our real estate we are the operator; everywhere else we invest behind operators we know and trust.</p>
      <div class="grid-3 verticals">
        <div class="card vertical-card">
          <span class="badge">Real Estate</span>
          <h3>Cash-Flowing Real Estate</h3>
          <p>Multifamily and select real estate we run hands-on: disciplined acquisition, renovations, leasing, and asset management by our own team over a long hold.</p>
          <a href="/what-we-invest-in#real-estate" class="card-link">Read more &rarr;</a>
        </div>
        <div class="card vertical-card">
          <span class="badge">Energy</span>
          <h3>Oil &amp; Gas</h3>
          <p>Income-producing energy assets through trusted operators, with attention to tax efficiency and a long-standing relationship at the center of our access.</p>
          <a href="/what-we-invest-in#energy" class="card-link">Read more &rarr;</a>
        </div>
        <div class="card vertical-card">
          <span class="badge">Private Credit</span>
          <h3>Private Credit / Income Strategies</h3>
          <p>Income-oriented positions with a capital-preservation mindset, underwriting discipline, and selectivity about the operators we lend behind.</p>
          <a href="/what-we-invest-in#private-credit" class="card-link">Read more &rarr;</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="disclaimer" style="margin-top: 2rem; max-width: 65ch;">All investments involve risk, including the possible loss of principal. Tax outcomes depend on individual circumstances and are not guaranteed. Nothing on this page constitutes an offer to sell or a solicitation of an offer to buy securities.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What Makes Bidwell Different -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="section-label">What Makes Bidwell Different</span>
      <h2>A narrower focus, by design.</h2>
      <p class="section-intro">We are not interested in chasing every market cycle or promoting every trending asset class. Our focus is narrower: cash-flowing assets, hands-on operations, thoughtful underwriting, and long-term stewardship.</p>
      <div class="grid-3 diff-grid">
        <div class="card diff-card">
          <h3>Operator mindset</h3>
          <p>On much of our real estate, we are the operator: acquisition, leasing, renovations, and day-to-day asset management, handled by our own team. That work shapes every underwrite.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card diff-card">
          <h3>Cash flow over speculation</h3>
          <p>We prefer assets that pay you to own them. Appreciation, when it comes, is a secondary outcome we never count on.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card diff-card">
          <h3>Trusted operators, or ourselves</h3>
          <p>When a deal calls for a third-party operator, we invest only behind people we know personally. When it does not, we run the asset with our own team.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card diff-card">
          <h3>Disciplined underwriting</h3>
          <p>We underwrite for downside first. Conservative assumptions, stress-tested cases, and a clear view of how each thesis can fail.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card diff-card">
          <h3>Tax-conscious structuring</h3>
          <p>We pay attention to how investments are structured for tax efficiency, alongside the broader return profile. Outcomes vary by investor.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card diff-card">
          <h3>Built for the long term</h3>
          <p>This is not a sprint, a trend, or a transaction. We build for generational wealth and steward capital with that horizon in mind.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Founder -->
  <section class="section section-tint">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="section-label">Founder</span>
      <div class="founder-grid">
        <div class="founder-photo">
          <img src="/photos/adam-penn.jpg" alt="Adam Penn, Founder of Bidwell Capital" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div class="founder-bio">
          <h2>Adam Penn</h2>
          <p>Adam Penn began investing in 2017 and has spent nearly a decade acquiring, operating, and building businesses around cash-flowing real assets. With a background in software engineering, Adam brings a systems-first, data-driven approach to investing and operations.</p>
          <p style="margin-top: 1rem;">His experience across real estate, short-term rental operations, private credit, and energy investments shapes Bidwell Capital's practical, operator-led investment philosophy.</p>
          <div style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">
            <a href="/about" class="btn btn-outline">More About Bidwell</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Investor Club -->
  <section class="section section-tint">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="club-grid">
        <div>
          <span class="section-label">Investor Club</span>
          <h2>Get access before the public</h2>
          <p>Bidwell Capital offerings are available exclusively through our Investor Club under SEC Regulation D, Rule 506(b). Our deals are not publicly advertised. They are shared directly with qualified members.</p>
          <p style="margin-top: 1rem;">Club members get first look at new deals, access to our Deal Observer program to follow active positions in real time, monthly updates on portfolio performance, and direct access to our team.</p>
          <p style="margin-top: 1rem;">Membership is free. We just need to verify that you qualify as an accredited investor through a short introductory call.</p>
          <div style="margin-top: 2rem;">
            <a href="/contact#book" class="btn btn-primary">Schedule a Qualification Call</a>
          </div>
          <p class="disclaimer" style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">Under SEC Rule 506(b), securities may only be offered to accredited investors and up to 35 sophisticated non-accredited investors. No general solicitation or advertising is permitted.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="club-perks">
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Early deal access</h3>
            <p>See new opportunities before they close. Many of our deals fill quickly.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card" style="margin-top: 1rem;">
            <h3>Deal Observer</h3>
            <p>Not ready to invest? Watch how our active deals perform with real monthly updates. No commitment required.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card" style="margin-top: 1rem;">
            <h3>Direct communication</h3>
            <p>No gatekeepers. You get direct access to our team and transparent reporting on every deal.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Investment Philosophy -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="section-label">Investment Philosophy</span>
      <h2>What we believe matters.</h2>
      <p class="section-intro">Six principles guide every underwrite: cash flow, taxes, relationships, operations, stewardship, and patience. The full philosophy explains each one and how it shows up in practice.</p>
      <a href="/philosophy" class="btn btn-outline">Read the full philosophy</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Final CTA -->
  <section class="section section-tint">
    <div class="container cta-wrap">
      <span class="section-label">Connect</span>
      <h2>If our approach resonates, we would like to meet you.</h2>
      <p class="cta-sub">We start with a conversation. No pitch, no pressure.</p>
      <div style="margin-top: 2rem;">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Connect With Us</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding: 6rem 0 4rem;
    min-height: 60vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .hero {
      min-height: auto;
      padding: 2rem 0 2.5rem;
    }
  }

  .hero h1 {
    margin: 0.5rem 0 1.5rem;
  }

  .hero-sub {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    max-width: 60ch;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .stat-card {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 2rem;
  }

  .stat-value {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .stat-label {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .club-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 3rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .club-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr;
      gap: 4rem;
      align-items: start;
    }
  }

  .intro-narrow {
    max-width: 56rem;
  }

  .intro-narrow h2 {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    max-width: 22ch;
  }

  .lede {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    max-width: 60ch;
  }

  .section-intro {
    max-width: 60ch;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .verticals .vertical-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .vertical-card h3 {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .vertical-card p {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .card-link {
    margin-top: auto;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .diff-grid .diff-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .philosophy-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem 2.5rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .philosophy-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 1000px) {
    .philosophy-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .philosophy-item {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding-top: 1.25rem;
  }

  .philosophy-item h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .founder-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .founder-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 280px 1fr;
      gap: 3rem;
      align-items: center;
    }
  }

  .founder-photo img {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 280px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .founder-bio h2 {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .cta-wrap {
    max-width: 48rem;
  }

  .cta-wrap h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.25rem);
    max-width: 30ch;
  }

  .cta-sub {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
  }
</style>
